  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Administrative expenses on expert activities in international taxation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Administrat&#xed;vne n&#xe1;klady na expertn&#xe9; aktivity v oblasti medzin&#xe1;rodn&#xe9;ho zda&#x148;ovania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Admnistrative expenses related to the participation at the meeting of Committee of Experts on International Cooperation in Tax Matters covering transfer pricing issues in extractive industries, March 21-23, 2017 in Amsterdam, Netherlands. Development of UN Policy Guidance Note.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Admnistrat&#xed;vne n&#xe1;klady spojen&#xe9; so zasadnut&#xed;m Rady expertov OSN pre medzin&#xe1;rodn&#xe9; zda&#x148;ovanie zameran&#xe9; na aspekty transf&#xe9;rov&#xe9;ho oce&#x148;ovania v &#x165;a&#x17e;obnom priemysle, 21.-23.3.2017, Amsterdam, Holandsko. Pr&#xed;prava pracovn&#xe9;ho n&#xe1;vrhu UN Policy Guidance Note.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
